flowchart TD
    A([Begin]) --> B[Read account number]
    B --> C{Account found?}
    C -->|No| D[Print not found]
    C -->|Yes| E[Read amount]
    E --> F{Balance >= amount?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Subtract amount]
    F -->|No| H[Print insufficient funds]
    G --> I[Print remaining balance]
    D --> J([Return])
    H --> J
    I --> J
